---
import MainTemplate from "../templates/main-template.astro";
import Container from "../components/container.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

// Media imports
import hero from "../media/about/hero.jpg";
import about from "../media/about/about.webp";
import media from "../media/about/media.jpg";
import music from "../media/about/music.jpg";
import adventure from "../media/about/adventure.webp";   
---

<MainTemplate title="McLean Mylymok | About" description="Learn more about me. Find out about my hobbies, and interests. " author="McLean Mylymok" keywords={[
    "about",
    "me",
    "hobbies",
    "interests"
  ]} >
    <section class="hero-ladysmith">
        <figure class="hero-ladymith__media-wrapper">
            <Image src={hero} class="hero-ladysmith__media" alt="Me in front of some flowers at Vancouver Island University" />
        </figure>
        <Container width="standard" smartSpacing customClass="hero-ladysmith__inner">
            <h1 class="hero-ladysmith__seo-heading">About</h1>
            <span class="hero-ladysmith__heading">Meet the Nerdiest Man on Earth: Me.</span>
            <p class="hero-ladysmith__body">Here, you'll get a closer look at who I am through my passions, interests, and the things that have shaped me. Dive into my hobbies and personal story to learn what drives me and makes me unique..</p>
        </Container>
    </section>

    <!-- About section -->
     <section class="content-kelowna content-kelowna--about">
		  <Container width="standard" smartSpacing>
			<h2 class="content-kelowna__heading">Who Am I</h2>
			<div class="content-kelowna__grid">
				<div class="content-kelowna__content">
					<article class="content-kelowna--about__text">

                    <p class="hero-kelowna__body">Oh, hello there! Right away, there are two things that you should know about me. First, I’m extremely funny, and love all kinds of humor. Secondly, I live with Cerebral Palsy, which for me, affects my physical functions. I use an eyegaze system to communicate with peers, and complete work. Anything you can do with a keyboard and mouse, I can do with my eyes.</p>
                    <p class="hero-kelowna__body">
                    Throughout my life, I’ve moved a few times. I was born on the Sunshine Coast, then lived on Texada Island for a few years before, moved to the Ocenside area for a decade, and now I live in Kelowna. I have managed to create a circle of friends and family around me who are constantly challenging me to make the most of life. The people in my circle care about my academic performance, musical interests, and overall wellbeing. 
                    </p>
                    </article>
				</div> <!-- end about content -->
				<figure class="content-kelowna__media-wrapper">
					<Image src={about} class="content-kelowna__media" alt="me going on a walk on my street in my walker" title="I love going on walks with my walker. It's a good way to move around, and keep active." />
				</figure>
			</div>
		  </Container>
	  </section>

      <!-- Hobbies -->
       <section class="hobbies">
        <Container width="standard" smartSpacing customClass="hobbies__inner">
                <h2 class="hobbies__heading">My Hobbies</h2>

                <ul class="hobbies__list">
                    <li class="hobby__item">
                        <article class="hobby">
                            <div class="hobby__content">
                                <h3 class="hobby-heading">Media Production
                                </h3>
                                <p class="hobby-body">I am extremely enthusiastic about media production. Web design is my passion, however I’m also quite proficient with audio production, and photography. I use industry standard software and produce my content with quality in mind.</p>
                            </div> <!-- end hobby content -->
                            <figure class="hobby__media-wrapper">
                                <Image src={media} class="hobby__media" alt="a picture of a camera"  title="by Billy Freeman on unsplash.com taken on September 26th, 2023  https://unsplash.com/photos/a-man-holding-a-camera-up-to-his-face-vcue7q-6tYY" />
                            </figure>
                        </article>
                    </li>
                    <!-- and hobby -->
                        <li class="hobby__item">
                            <article class="hobby">
                                <div class="hobby__content">
                                    <h3 class="hobby-heading">Music
                                    </h3>
                                    <p class="hobby-body">Whether it is listening to a CD, curating playlists, or strumming my guitar, I find enjoyment in music daily. I listen to various styles such as indie, country, and rock and roll, and am always on the lookout for new finds. My collection of CDs is something that I take pride in. Throughout the years, I have attended all kinds of events and concerts such as <a href="https://squamish.ca/projects-plans-and-initiatives/projects-and-initiatives/completed-projects/2016-completed-projects/svmf/" target="_blank" title="you are about to go to another website to find out about the Squamish Valley Music Festival. Don't worry, we'll open it in a new tab" class="inline-link">The Squamish Valley Music Festival</a>, <a href="https://sunfestconcerts.com/" target="_blank" title="you are about to go to another website to find out about Sunfest. Don't worry, we'll open it in a new tab" class="inline-link">Sunfest</a>, The Bahamas, Snow Patrol, and Blue Rodeo, as well as a trip to Nashville and Memphis. I value music that comes across as authentic and has an acoustic component.</p>
                                </div> <!-- end hobby content -->
                                <figure class="hobby__media-wrapper">
                                    <Image src={music} class="hobby__media" alt="Me smiling inside  Ameoba records in Hollywood."  title="Ameoba records is very cool. You should definitely check it out!" />
                                </figure>
                            </article>
                        </li>
                    <!-- and hobby -->

                        <li class="hobby__item">
                            <article class="hobby">
                                <div class="hobby__content">
                                    <h3 class="hobby-heading">Adventuring</h3>
                                    <p class="hobby-body">I have been biking and camping for as long as I can remember. My camping adventures include Denman Island, Texada Island, Banff, and up and down Vancouver Island. I also look forward to a good road trip. My family is all about the next adventure. Over this past summer, we paddleboarded around Okanagan Lake. I loved it!  Another favorite activity is skiing. For the past nine years, I’ve been part of <a href="https://visasweb.ca/" target="_blank" title="you are about to go to another website to find out about the Vancouver Island Society for Adaptive Snowsports. Don't worry, we'll open it in a new tab" class="inline-link">Vancouver Island Society for Adaptive Snowsports</a>. Through this organization, I have learned how to drive a sitski with complete independence. After each lesson, I feel exhilarated and accomplished.</p>
                                </div> <!-- end hobby content -->
                                <figure class="hobby__media-wrapper">
                                    <Image src={adventure} class="hobby__media" alt="Me paddlboarding on Lake Okanagan with my parents, and my brother."  title="paddlboarding is super fun. You should try it out!" />
                                </figure>
                            </article>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                    <!-- and hobby -->
        </Container>
        </section>
        <!-- Music -->
         <section class="music">
        <Container width="standard" smartSpacing customClass="music__inner">
                <div class="music__content">
                    <h2 class="music__heading">My Musical Taste</h2>
                    <p class="music__body">Some people say that I have a taste of a 52 year old – according to Spotify, that’s true! I enjoy tracks that have a sense of craftsmanship. My favorite band right now is Blue Rodeo. I enjoy their music, because it’s easy to play and sing along to. Their songs are about relatable subjects, and it is just really good content. I’ve created a playlist of songs that have the most meaning to me and illustrate my musical preferences. </p>
                </div>
                <iframe data-testid="embed-iframe" style="border-radius:12px" src="https://open.spotify.com/embed/playlist/6fy3ylkc8ozyQzCyVTZpaW?utm_source=generator" width="100%" height="352" frameBorder="0" allowfullscreen="" allow="autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" loading="lazy"></iframe>
        </Container>
         </section>
</MainTemplate>